    <string name="bj_help_title">How to play Blackjack</string>
    <string name="bj_help_text">Get closer to 21 than the dealer without going over. Number cards count their number, face cards count 10 and an Ace counts 1 or 11.\n\nPlace a bet with the chips, then play each hand: Hit takes a card, Stand stops, Double doubles your bet for exactly one more card, Split turns a pair into two hands, and Surrender gives up the hand for half your bet back.\n\nA blackjack (an Ace and a ten-value card) pays 3 to 2, or 6 to 5 at some tables. If the dealer shows an Ace you may buy insurance. Tap Hint for the basic-strategy move.\n\nThese are play chips only. There is no real money. If you run out you can rebuy.</string>
