    <string name="wr_help_title">How to play War</string>
    <string name="wr_help_text">The deck is dealt out. Every round each player turns over their top card, and the highest card (Ace is high) wins both cards.\n\nIf the top cards tie, it is war: each tied player puts cards face down, then flips one more, and the higher card takes the whole pile. If a player runs out of cards during a war, they lose it.\n\nIn Choose 3 you see your top three cards and secretly pick one to play. Pass the device between people when prompted so nobody sees your cards.\n\nYou win by holding every card. After the round limit the bigger pile wins.</string>
