    <!-- First-run tips (GameTips.kt carries the English lines) -->
    <string name="tip_blackjack_1">Tap chips to build a bet, then press Place bet. Play chips only; no real money.</string>
    <string name="tip_blackjack_2">Hit to draw, Stand to stop, Double to double your bet for one card, Split a pair into two hands.</string>
    <string name="tip_blackjack_3">Go over 21 and you bust. Tap Hint any time for the basic-strategy move.</string>
    <string name="tip_war_1">Tap Flip. The higher card takes both. Aces are high.</string>
    <string name="tip_war_2">A tie is a war: each tied player puts cards face down, then flips a deciding card.</string>
    <string name="tip_war_3">In Choose 3, pick one of your top three cards in secret. Spend your aces wisely.</string>
